WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: sl

00:00:00.384 --> 00:00:03.281
Jutro se začne ob reki Kolpi.

00:00:03.412 --> 00:00:04.688
in si v reki.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.562
Kolpa se ne mudi.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.844
Dve hiši, dva naslova v Gribljah.

00:00:10.162 --> 00:00:12.656
Štirje samostojni apartmaji.

00:00:13.335 --> 00:00:16.406
Terasa, jacuzzi, vrt.

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:19.219
Otrokom cel travnik.

00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:22.969
Gostje rečejo: popolna zasebnost.

00:00:23.413 --> 00:00:25.781
in luči, ko se stemni.

00:00:26.201 --> 00:00:30.000
River Kolpa Apartments. Pokličite Majdo.
